As a beginner in Korean, you probably already did a great job cramming hundreds of words. However, you still need to learn grammar. Textbooks help to get a grasp on the basics, but you might feel like missing out on something. 

This app comprehensively covers the TOPIK I grammar course. Clear, explicit explanations and helpful examples will help you effortlessly master everything you need to pass the test with flying colors.

If you don't know where to start, take a test! You will find hundreds of real TOPIK test examples in the 'Review Test' section.

The TOPIK I Grammar app features:

- 120+ essential Korean grammar principles (Beginner and Lower Intermediate levels);
- hundreds of past TOPIK grammar problems with answers linked to articles;
- clear and explicit explanations organized into bite-size chunks;
- rich collection of examples from modern Korean;
- pronunciation for each Korean example sentence;
- searchable Korean and English index of all articles;
- bookmark system;
- supports iPhone and iPad.

CrocoMath is a great application for our kids to have a lot of fun with mathematics and at the same time to easily learn and improve their overall skills with math tables.

The application uses an approach that encourages learning. If the kids needs help to solve an exercise they can touch Croco, their math teacher, to ask for an hint and they’ll get a big jump on learning the basic arithmetic, while enjoying every second of that education experience.

You'll be surprised to receive requests to do more math exercises from your child!

Some features:
* math matching game to memorize and learn the math tables;
* 40 flash cards to learn math tables;
* timer mode;
* very simple design, ideal for our kids;
* simple enough to encourage kids to keep trying;
* exciting vibrant colors, in HD for iPad;
* simple and immediate user interface, specifically designated for this purpose;
* numbers are big and easily visible to kids;
* expressly and exclusively designed for the iPad with use of the finger touch features to control the game.

